MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

propose_task_plan on the connector returned renderPlan's four-part card
(title, version, solved-when, routes, people, never-ask). It now returns
what the app shows: planInSentences plus PLAN_CLOSING_QUESTION, in the
plan's own language (the connector has no conversation, so the plan's
words decide: detectRunLanguage). proposeTaskPlan also returns the
sentence; the app's path is unchanged.

The two texts of 1.1 ship with it, word for word as approved (§110.5):
the propose_task_plan description's summary sentence and the plan
parameter's description.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
